ntiate a (1 - cosx)  with respect to a (x - sinx)?<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"tan⁡ x/2   <br>","option2":"cosec⁡ x/2<br>","option3":"cotx<br>","option4":"cot⁡ x/2<br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_MxztUiT.png\" width=\"530\" height=\"108\"></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613061,"slug":"12309-137","question":"73384. <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_pudI1GO.png\" width=\"328\" height=\"63\"><br>","syllabus":"","option1":"sinx - cosx<br>","option2":"1<br>","option3":"0<br>","option4":"sin2x<br>","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_WInPRFc.png\" width=\"564\" height=\"132\"></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613060,"slug":"12309-136","question":"73383. What is the Range of Sigma (সিগমা) function? <br>","syllabus":"","option1":"(- ∞, ∞)<br>","option2":"[0, ∞)<br>","option3":"(- ∞, 1]<br>","option4":"{- 1, 0, 1} <br>","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_UmZhFjZ.png\" width=\"656\" height=\"192\"></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613058,"slug":"12309-135","question":"73382. Which is the condition where the tangent line (স্পর্শরেখা) of y = f(x) at (x, y) makes an acute angle (সূক্ষ্মকোন) with x-axis? <br>","syllabus":"","option1":"<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_laQnRUr.png\" width=\"139\" height=\"101\"><br>","option2":"<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_oR2zR6h.png\" width=\"134\" height=\"81\"><br>","option3":"<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_OXyTQpA.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"80\"><br>","option4":"<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_C5UJBXu.png\" width=\"119\" height=\"77\"><br>","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p>If dy/dx &gt; 0, then the tangent line (স্পর্শরেখা) of y = f(x) at (x, y) makes an acute angle (সূক্ষ্মকোন) with x - axis.</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613057,"slug":"12309-134","question":"73381. If f(x) is an even function and g(x) is an odd function then f(x) g (x)=?<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"odd function<br>","option2":"even function<br>","option3":"Sine function<br>","option4":"none<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p>Let,  P(x) = f(x) g (x) ⟹ P(-x) = f(-x) g (-x)    [since f(x) is an even function so f(-x) =f(x) <br>                                                                      and  g(x) is an odd function so g (-x) = -g (x)]<br>= f(x) {-g (x)} = -f(x) g(x)<br>⟹ P(-x) = -P(x)  So f(x) g (x) is odd function</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613056,"slug":"12309-133","question":"73380. What is the function <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_2XMM0UU.png\" width=\"406\" height=\"117\"><br>","syllabus":"","option1":"continuous <br>","option2":"discontinuous<br>","option3":"differentiability<br>","option4":"ক + গ<br>","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_0eB8O1V.png\" width=\"568\" height=\"437\"></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":613055,"slug":"12309-132","question":"73379. If  f : R → R and f(x) = (x + 1)<sup>2</sup>, then <em>f </em><sup>-1</sup> (4)=?<br>","syllabus":"","option1":"± 1<br>","option2":"± 5<br>","option3":"0<br>","o